# 🎬 MOVIERSE

<p align="center">
  <img src="" alt="MOVIERSE" width="800">
</p>

## 🎬 About

MOVIERSE is a desktop-based movie discovery and recommendation application developed with **Python and PyQt6**. It allows users to discover movies and get similar movie recommendations using a content-based recommendation system.

## ✨ Features

* 🎬 Movie discovery and listing
* 🔎 Search and category filtering
* 🎲 Random movie selection
* 🤖 Content-based movie recommendations
* ⭐ IMDb rating information
* 🎭 Genre and actor analysis
* 🖼️ Movie posters via OMDb API

## 🛠️ Technologies

**Python · PyQt6 · PostgreSQL · Scikit-learn · Pandas · NumPy · OMDb API · Joblib**

## 🤖 Recommendation System

MOVIERSE uses **TF-IDF, MultiLabelBinarizer and Cosine Similarity** to analyze movie information and recommend similar movies.

